WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.700
Your building. Made interactive. — For builders, developers and architects. Present your vision to investors and clients.

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:10.400
Present the complete vision — Let clients explore the site, spaces and amenities

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:15.100
Show the life within — Furnished 3D interiors, visible beyond the facade

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:26.800
Guide clients to what matters — Clickable hotspots bring key project locations into focus

00:00:26.800 --> 00:01:08.000
Present every unit clearly — Status, size and budget. Then explore the same unit in 3D.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:13.700
Step inside — Junior suite walkthrough

00:01:13.700 --> 00:01:19.400
Present spaces with purpose — Presidential suite: connected living, dining and rest

00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:27.100
Light changes everything — Adjust daylight in real time

00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:38.800
Set the atmosphere — Explore weather presets and a different mood

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:47.500
Ready to present — Saved views, high-resolution photos and quality presets

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:53.200
Put your project in perspective — Architecture, amenities and setting in one clear view

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:59.200
Bring your next project to life — An interactive presentation for your investors and clients.
